        <detaileddescription>
<para>Function to get the multiplier based on the selected tolerance</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Narrow tolerance (index 0) divides by 2.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Normal tolerance (index 1) keeps unchanged.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Large tolerance (index 2) multiplies by 4. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
